<fieldset class="comm-muted-block" style="margin:20px 0"><legend>When to send</legend><label>Delivery option<select name="send_mode" data-send-mode><option value="draft">Save draft</option><option value="now">Review &amp; send now</option><option value="later">Schedule for later</option></select></label><div data-schedule-fields hidden><label>Send date &amp; time · West Africa Time (UTC+1)<input type="datetime-local" name="scheduled_at" disabled></label><label>Maximum credits for this scheduled send<input name="budget_units" type="number" min="1" max="1000000" disabled></label><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" data-schedule-consent disabled> I authorize this campaign to use up to this cap when due.</label><p class="muted">The audience is checked when the campaign is due. If the cost exceeds your cap or the channel is unavailable, the schedule pauses. Credits are used only as messages are sent. Your Administrator must enable scheduled sending.</p></div><p class="muted" data-send-note>Saving a draft sends nothing.</p></fieldset>
